<Program Use="Target" Name="S01_MidBaseEscapement" TestEdits="false" MainRoutineName="R00_Main" Disabled="false" Class="Standard" UseAsFolder="false">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Generated by SDC Engineer v1.4.0 (2026-08-25) - SDC State Logic Builder
Mid-Base Escapement - singulates one mid base off the feeder track and presents it to the Mid-Base Pick And Place. Owns Escapement Finger 1, the Escapement Shuttle, the Shuttle Gripper and the Nest Part Present sensor. Partner signals produced: p_PartReadyForPick, p_ShuttleGripperOpen. Partner signals consumed (engineer placeholders): part gripped, part clear.]]>
